&trans  &trans  &trans        &kp C_VOL_UP  &mc1          &mc0    &mc0  &mc1    &trans        &trans      &trans            &trans
                &kp C_BRI_DN  &kp C_VOL_DN  &kp C_BRI_UP                &trans  &trans        &trans
            >;
